{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫集團慶祝59周年台慶，台前幕後一眾職藝員齊齊慶祝。</p><p></p><p>無綫集團行政主席許濤、總經理蕭世和為台慶揭開序幕。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TVB.BIRTHDAY-2300.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026QJXdzsmg9b1795102366.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>三屆視帝羅家良強勢回歸，身穿「一套西裝」的「奇哥」，以「十足的風度」率先送上祝福，與新世代藝人，帶大家重溫《難兄難弟》的光輝歲月。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TVB.BIRTHDAY-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026I1AYQDWNhA1795103033.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TVB.BIRTHDAY-2300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026IFsXsfgDfs1795103056.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>「中年好聲音」唱將，帶來多首勁歌金曲，一眾女演員亦落力演出。</p><p></p><p>六位《東張西望》女主持無懼寒風，以400米跑步比賽，展現外景採訪的衝勁。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TVB.BIRTHDAY-2300_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026IGqhtNmHcH1795103073.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>施展渾身解數的還有他們，向經典場景背後特技組等功臣致敬。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TVB.BIRTHDAY-2300_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wzVEOgoLlq1795103113.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TVB.BIRTHDAY-2300_005.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026moTs99q6Qg1795103130.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TVB.BIRTHDAY-2300_006.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202633468t5JJq1795103156.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>「阿姐」汪明荃就特意拍攝短片，感謝梳化服同事。台慶亦以人工智能製作的短片，感謝工作多年的幕後英雄。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-20-00h03m18s232.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026o4gDsUsfGS1795104221.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>TVBUDDY拉大隊走出電視城，帶同逾80名小生花旦，來到下月初才正式啟用的中九龍繞道九龍灣段，以歌舞表演賀壽。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TVB.BIRTHDAY-2300_008.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026C1WO3uCQNE1795103219.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>無綫電視1967年11月19日啟播，是全港首間商營的無線電視台。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:40:46.319937+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":356,"images":9,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T15:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T16:54:09.487832+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:33:57.774150+00:00","content_hash":"f051c70609f8e44157d7f77e7762242394e9efe89aa00272817c850c5bbd54d0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:40:46.319937+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}